  "Title": "DC Voltage Doubler",
  "Description": "Classic Greinacher half-wave voltage doubler driven by a 5 V peak AC sine source. Uses a clamp diode (D1), pump capacitor (C1), rectifier diode (D2), shunt reservoir capacitor (C2), load resistor, and LED indicator to double input AC peak into ~9 V DC.",
